  "description": "Two storey front extension incorporating porch, Single storey front to side extension, Single and two storey rear extension, Raising of main roof, 2no. Roof lights in side roof slopes, Patio to rear, Alterations to external facade from render to brick/render finish, External alterations (Demolition of front porch and detached garage)",
